OL,3,AFrance prepares for day of protest a
OL,4,Aweek after nationwide riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance is on high alert ahead of a new
OL,7,Fday of nationwide protests on Saturday,
OL,8,Fa week after the country saw some of
OL,9,Fits worst unrest in decades.
OL,11,FSweeping restrictions have been imposed
OL,12,Fon demonstrations across France but
OL,13,Fhundreds of thousands of protesters are
OL,14,Fstill expected to gather in Paris and
OL,15,Felsewhere for a second round of
OL,16,Fprotests organised by students, trade
OL,17,Funions and wider anti-government
OL,18,Fgroups.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
