OL,3,AFrance prepares for day of protest a
OL,4,Aweek after nationwide riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe interior ministry has said it will
OL,7,Fdeploy 70,000 police officers, ramping
OL,8,Fup the security presence in French
OL,9,Fcities, after the government was
OL,10,Faccused by opposition parties of
OL,11,Ffailing to foresee the scale of the
OL,12,Funrest on 17 October.
OL,14,F"We will not let anything go
OL,15,Funchallenged," said Interior Minister
OL,16,FLaurent Nunez.
